    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A nothic eye, dried and sealed under purple glass, crowns the rod.</p><p>It has 2 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. As an action, you can expend 1 charge to choose a creature within 60 feet. It makes a [[/save ability=wis dc=13 format=long]], taking [[/damage 2d6 type=psychic]] damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature that fails also has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn.</p>",
